{"id":"sh/xobe1kbi","kind":"textbox","name":"verification-body","position":{"left":912,"top":594,"width":343,"height":98},"text":"Ubuntu 20.04.4 / Python 3.8.10：\n单 CPU 核心离线复核，9/9 项通过。\n4 套 RTL/XSim 测试台通过。\n4 个固件文件与原部署逐字节一致。\n基于 routed DCP 导出，未重跑综合布线。","style":{"fontSize":14.67,"typeface":"Microsoft YaHei","color":"#20262E","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect"},
{"id":"sh/vmtwzatc","kind":"textbox","name":"dialogue-heading","position":{"left":443,"top":361,"width":350,"height":30},"text":"KV260 编排对话与播放闭环","style":{"fontSize":14.67,"typeface":"Microsoft YaHei","color":"#20262E","bold":true,"alignment":"center"},"geometry":"rect"},
{"id":"sh/9krex0b6","kind":"textbox","name":"motion-design","position":{"left":443,"top":584,"width":344,"height":107},"text":"视觉感知与受约束的运动控制\n一个 B4096 DPU 共享三个视觉模型。\nPS 跟踪 → RTL 校验 → PWM 输出。\n校验会话、序号、速率及命令租约。","style":{"fontSize":14.67,"typeface":"Microsoft YaHei","color":"#20262E","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"roundRect","fillColor":"#FFFFFF","lineColor":"#000000","lineWidth":1.33},
{"id":"sh/mh0fm5cv","kind":"textbox","name":"dialogue-sequence","position":{"left":443,"top":403,"width":344,"height":165},"text":"1  VAD 触发板端 Paraformer ASR。\n2  文本和上下文 → Windows LLM。\n3  板端校验回复文本、情绪和形象动作，再单独调用 TTS。\n4  语音与形象同步播放，完整回执后提交历史。","style":{"fontSize":14.67,"typeface":"Microsoft YaHei","color":"#20262E","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"roundRect","fillColor":"#FFFFFF","lineColor":"#000000","lineWidth":1.33},
