{"id":"sh/4ryxcveh","kind":"textbox","name":"goals-body","position":{"left":28,"top":431,"width":360,"height":104},"text":"单个 DPU 共享执行目标检测与人脸识别。\n无需唤醒词，语音活动触发对话。\n对话、记忆和播放由板端统一管理。\n自研 RTL 约束转轴命令与输出。","style":{"fontSize":14.67,"typeface":"Microsoft YaHei","color":"#20262E","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
